# The siege arm, doubled: two artillery per five fighting units.
#
# If one c_artillery in the mix halves the drops and kills one economy in
# three (screen-vh9 round one), the dose-response question is whether the
# effect scales with the dose or the first tube already saturates it.

name aa-counter-guard-arty2
goals extractorT1,extractorT1,extractorT1,c_tank,c_tank,c_tank,hoverTank,c_artillery,c_artillery
max_workers 8
mass 25
reserve -1
expand 1
counter 1
cover 0
intercept 1
guard_cap 0
aa_cover 0
forward 0
scout 0
raid 0
rush 0
creep 0
riposte 0
tech 0
